  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BD1 - M&amp;E, Research and Design (2021-2025)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The investment supports a high quality, strategic and effective development
program through the procurement of M&amp;E, design, technical assistance and research services.
These services will support the program to meet DFAT&apos;s performance and quality requirements
and support the program to continue contributing to the objectives of the Bangladesh COVID-19
Development Response Plan (CDRP) and in turn, Australia&apos;s Partnerships for Recovery policy. The total value of this investment is up to $1m over 4 financial years (1 December 2021 - 30 November 2025).</narrative>
  </description>
